## 9. Project Completion Goal

The goal is to deliver a maintainable and testable trading-engine prototype with a clearly documented architecture, validated order-processing behavior, reproducible performance measurements, and transparent limitations.

Correctness, repeatability, and evidence-based optimization take priority over unverified claims of production readiness or ultra-low latency.